; Forwards the app state API set to twinapi.appcore, as in Wine 11.
; The module name needs ".dll", because "twinapi.appcore" already has a dot.
; The GPTK Wine (Wine 7.7) has only stubs for these functions.
LIBRARY api-ms-win-core-psm-appnotify-l1-1-0.dll
EXPORTS
RegisterAppStateChangeNotification = twinapi.appcore.dll.RegisterAppStateChangeNotification
UnregisterAppStateChangeNotification = twinapi.appcore.dll.UnregisterAppStateChangeNotification
